network-monitor (1.0.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging from the upstream 1.0.8 release.
  * Use the distribution-provided PySide6, pyqtgraph, pyroute2, and NumPy
    packages instead of the upstream bundled runtime.
  * Install the PolicyKit policy and privileged blocking helper.
  * Mark distribution-managed installations so the in-app updater asks the
    user to update through the package manager.

